Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.33,0:01:48.88,OP-zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3a33\c&H6B463F&}我一定笑不出來也哭不出來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.29,0:01:51.34,OP-ja,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur3\3a33}運命共同体
